{"id": "n2_p8_10", "text": "Y cuatro, un detalle que me encanta: si en una pelea a alguien se le caen el sombrero o las gafas, puedes cogerlos y ponértelos. Literalmente, disfrazarte con la ropa del que acabas de tumbar.", "dur": 10.634739229024943, "words": ["Y", "cuatro,", "un", "detalle", "que", "me", "encanta:", "si", "en", "una", "pelea", "a", "alguien", "se", "le", "caen", "el", "sombrero", "o", "las", "gafas,", "puedes", "cogerlos", "y", "ponértelos.", "Literalmente,", "disfrazarte", "con", "la", "ropa", "del", "que", "acabas", "de", "tumbar."], "start": [0.24767952, 0.38699925, 0.9442782, 1.1145579, 1.4705971, 1.578957, 1.6563568, 2.5387151, 2.7554345, 2.8328345, 3.0031142, 3.3127136, 3.3436735, 3.622313, 3.7616327, 3.8699925, 4.086712, 4.1950717, 4.628511, 4.674951, 4.89167, 5.4489493, 5.7585487, 6.2384276, 6.315828, 7.5232654, 8.544943, 9.1177025, 9.257022, 9.334422, 9.566622, 9.721421, 9.814301, 10.1239, 10.21678], "end": [0.38699925, 0.85139835, 1.1145579, 1.4705971, 1.578957, 1.6563568, 2.1671958, 2.7554345, 2.8328345, 3.0031142, 3.3127136, 3.3436735, 3.622313, 3.7616327, 3.8699925, 4.086712, 4.1950717, 4.628511, 4.674951, 4.89167, 5.27867, 5.7585487, 6.2384276, 6.315828, 6.950506, 8.328224, 9.1177025, 9.257022, 9.334422, 9.566622, 9.721421, 9.814301, 10.1239, 10.21678, 10.603779]}